<title>FINLAND: POSTIPANKKI FINNISH ECONOMIC FORECAST IN FIGURES.</title>
<headline>POSTIPANKKI FINNISH ECONOMIC FORECAST IN FIGURES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned commercial</p>
<p>bank Postipankki Oy's economic research department on Thursday</p>
<p>released its new economic forecast (figs in pct unless stated):</p>
<p>				    1996	    1997	1998</p>
<p> GDP				+3.2	    +3.8	+3.2</p>
<p> Exports			  +3.8	    +5.0	+5.0</p>
<p> Imports			  +4.9	    +3.5	+5.4</p>
<p> Consumption		    +3.4	    +2.7	+2.2</p>
<p>   private			+3.5	    +3.0	+2.3</p>
<p>   public			 +2.9	    +1.8	+2.0</p>
<p> Fixed investment	     +5.3	    +4.7	+6.2</p>
<p> Unemployment		   16.3	    15.0	14.3</p>
<p> Real earnings		  +1.5	    +2.7	+2.1</p>
<p> CPI				+0.6	    +0.9	+1.5</p>
<p> Trade surplus (FIM bln)   +43.7	   +46.4	+50.4</p>
<p> C/A surplus (FIM bln)     +19.2	   +22.2	+22.7</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
